		(property "Design Note" "REV B, 2026-09-12: was AP63205WU-7 (5 V). The 5 V rail existed for ONE reason -- AZ431 headroom (see the old note on R41) -- and the AZ431 is gone, so the intermediate rail goes with it. DS41326 covers AP63200/01/03/05 as one family; only 3.3 V and 5.0 V are FIXED options, everything else needs the adjustable AP63200 plus a divider. Pin map is unchanged and still asserted in verify()"
