		(property "Design Note" "Taiyo Yuden 22 uF 16 V X7R 1206, already in Fab's stock (50 pcs, checked 2026-09-12). The voltage rating matters more than the value here: used at 3.3 V this part sits at 21 % of its rating in a 1206 X7R, the gentle end of the DC-bias curve -- against the 10 V X5R 0603 also in stock, which is the heavily-derating kind and must NOT be substituted. Eq.10's worst case wants 9.1 uF EFFECTIVE; confirm against Taiyo Yuden's DC-bias data before release"
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
