		(property "Design Note" "Series reverse-polarity Schottky, cathode to the load. Nexperia PMEG4010CEH: 40 V VRRM against a 15 V specified input and D1's 24.4 V clamp; 1 A IF against ~90 mA of heater plus 3 mA of board. VF is 340 mV typ / 390 mV max at 100 mA (Table 7), which is the 6.4 % of heater authority this part costs. Pin 1 is the CATHODE and faces +12V_SW -- reversing it does not fail ERC, it fails the probe"
