		(property "Design Note" "Single hand-solder land, back copper, carrying /I2C_SCL to a flying lead. Its power pair is J107 at the cable end and SDA is J108; the three are one connector in three pieces. Placed clear of the analog front end - routed from J107's row this net ran ~6 mm at the board minimum 0.100 mm from /VREF_TRIM. No pull-up here; R10/R11 already bias the bus. 3.3 V logic only."
			(at 0 5 0)
			(layer "B.Fab")
